  "description": {
   "en": "Mini is a \"Scum Detector\", and her latest job is from a rich girl who wants to test her boyfriend's loyalty. However, her boyfriend, Zhao Yueming, is a straightforward gentleman, and Mini's usual methods don't work on him. This is a bit tricky for Mini, who is used to dealing with scumbags regularly. This game of tug-of-war between the womanizer and the one who understands them best is about to begin. Who will fall into the trap of love first?!\n\n[Official Japanese Translation](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003618)\n[Official Korean Translation](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12220642)"
